  "description": "This Shaker hot chicken salad—creamy, tangy, and capped with a crunchy potato chip topping—gets a thoughtful upgrade with a quick homemade sauce, Dijon mustard, and dried tarragon.",
  "notes": "Optional substitutions: diced poached chicken → roasted chicken or store-bought rotisserie chicken; homemade chicken stock → store-bought low-sodium chicken broth\n\nMake-ahead and storage: Leftovers can be refrigerated up to 3 days, though the potato chip topping will get soggy. Reheat in 350°F oven, covered loosely with aluminum foil if needed to prevent burning, until warmed through.",
